# Smoke: configure a platform's codify guidance and accept it.
id: codify-config-smoke
skill: highway-codify-config
fixture: implementation
smoke: yes
open: /highway-codify-config GitHub Actions
ask: What would you add or correct?
say: [accept] Looks good.
ask-pattern: Would you like to configure coding standards for
say: [decline] Not now.
ask-pattern: Would you like help resolving these conflicts
say: [decline] Not now.
ask-pattern: If you'd like to cancel
say: [decline] Nothing else.
ask-pattern: How would you like to configure Highway Codify
say: [decline] Nothing else for now.
writes: library/coding-standards/**
expect: template library/coding-standards/codify-platforms.md :: codify-platforms.md
expect: row library/coding-standards/codify-platforms.md :: GitHub Actions
